        (B) $4,400 in the case of a head of household (as defined in section 2(b)), or


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section63:b0015; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section63(c)(2)(B); source-lines: 37-37; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
