    (2) the deduction for personal exemptions provided by section 151.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section63:b0031; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section63(d)(2); source-lines: 81-81; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
# This structural heading introduces no rule independently of its immediately following subprovisions.
